export const SITE_HTML = "<!-- NAV -->\n<nav class=\"nav\">\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">\n    <span class=\"logo-mark\"></span>\n    <span>DetencionDefensa<em style=\"font-style:italic;color:var(--accent-deep);font-weight:400;\">.com</em></span>\n  </a>\n  <ul class=\"nav-links\">\n    <li><a href=\"#not-law-firm\"><span data-es>NO somos abogados</span><span data-en>Not a Law Firm</span><span data-ht>Pa avoka</span></a></li>\n  </ul>\n  <div class=\"nav-right\">\n    <div class=\"lang-toggle\">\n      <button id=\"btn-es\" class=\"active\" onclick=\"setLang('es')\">ES</button>\n      <button id=\"btn-en\" onclick=\"setLang('en')\">EN</button>\n      <button id=\"btn-ht\" onclick=\"setLang('ht')\">HT</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lang-label\">Choose language · Elija idioma · Chwazi lang</div>\n    <a href=\"/intake\" class=\"nav-cta\">\n      <span data-es>Empezar — $199</span><span data-en>Start — $199</span><span data-ht>Kòmanse — $199</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n\n\n\n\<!-- HERO -->\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"hero-text reveal\">\n    <!-- KEY FEATURES --><style>.kf-sec{padding:4rem 1rem;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1e293b;}.kf-container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1rem;}.kf-title{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,5vw,2.5rem);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem;text-align:center;}.kf-sub{font-size:1.125rem;color:#64748b;margin:0 auto 3rem;max-width:600px;text-align:center;}.kf-grid{display:grid;gap:1.5rem;margin-top:2rem;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));}.kf-card{background:#fff;padding:1.5rem;border-radius:0.75rem;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;transition:all .3s;}.kf-card:hover{box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:#1e40af;}.kf-icon{font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem;}.kf-card h3{font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;}.kf-card p{color:#64748b;font-size:0.95rem;}</style><section id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"kf-sec\"><div class=\"kf-container\"><h2 class=\"kf-title\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;\">Key Features <a href=\"/checkout\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;padding:0.6rem 1.25rem;background:#1e40af;color:#fff;border-radius:0.5rem;text-decoration:none;\">Get Started →</a></h2><p class=\"kf-sub\">Complete protection designed for non-citizens.</p><div class=\"kf-grid\"><div class=\"kf-card\"><div class=\"kf-icon\">🛡️</div><h3>Private &amp; Secure Data</h3><p>DetencionDefensa uses the highest encryption software available. Once you complete the intake process, all of that information is transferred to your phone and not held on our servers. Immediately after your forms are completed, your attorney receives them and reviews them. This creates an attorney-client privilege under U.S. law. That means no one but you and your attorney can access them, not even with a court order. The only one who can release the information is you, once you complete the intake process.</p></div><div class=\"kf-card\"><div class=\"kf-icon\">⚡</div><h3>One-Click Emergency</h3><p>Upon completing the forms an emergency app downloads to your phone. You enter your emergency contacts and a PIN number. If you feel you're going to be detained, hold the button down three seconds. Immediately, DetencionDefensa.com is notified that you're at risk of being arrested. Your attorney is notified, and your family is notified. DetencionDefensa.com begins locating you within hours, and your family is advised when and where you were detained so they can pick up your vehicle, secure your property, and rescue your dog.</p></div><div class=\"kf-card\"><div class=\"kf-icon\">💰</div><h3>Designed for Hard Working Immigrant Population</h3><p>Who can afford ten thousand dollars? Especially if you are a hardworking family member just detained. The DetencionDefensa program is designed to provide low-cost legal defense to individuals at risk of detention. Seven out of ten people detained by ICE are not prepared and cannot hire an attorney. With the DetencionDefensa program, you pay $199 today and save thousands tomorrow.</p></div><div class=\"kf-card\"><div class=\"kf-icon\">🌐</div><h3>Multilingual</h3><p>The DetencionDefensa program is designed to provide a true multilingual opportunity for non-English speaking, reading, and writing individuals to access the courts at low cost through an attorney-reviewed process. Once detained, most people do not have access to anything but the English court-provided forms and are unable to access the courts without paying thousands for an attorney.</p></div><div class=\"kf-card\"><div class=\"kf-icon\">📱</div><h3>Specialized App</h3><p>The only app that notifies your family, your lawyer, and begins searching for you once triggered. Unlike other apps, this app sends your documents to your contacts and your lawyer for immediate action.</p></div><div class=\"kf-card\"><div class=\"kf-icon\">✓</div><h3>Verified Legal Support</h3><p>With DetencionDefensa, all the legal documents we translate and type are reviewed by a Florida-licensed attorney before the customer gets them. Nothing is ever filed in court that is not attorney-approved.</p></div></div></div></section>\n\n<!-- ATTORNEY -->\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about-attorney\" style=\"padding:3rem 1.25rem;\">\n  <div class=\"section-header reveal\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <div class=\"section-tag\"><span data-en>About Your Attorney</span><span data-es>Sobre Su Abogado</span><span data-ht>Konsènan Avoka Ou</span></div>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\" style=\"letter-spacing:0.02em;\"><span data-en>About Your Attorney</span><span data-es>Sobre Su Abogado</span><span data-ht>Konsènan Avoka Ou</span></h2>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"reveal\" style=\"max-width:60rem;margin:1.5rem auto 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:1.25rem;\">\n    <img src=\"/__l5e/assets-v1/39468bab-2418-455f-af3b-71fc939b832e/rosario-sorrentino.png\" alt=\"Rosario Sorrentino, Esq.\" style=\"width:240px;height:240px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:50%;border:3px solid #6B4F4F;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    <div style=\"font-family:'Libre Baskerville',Georgia,serif;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#0a0a0a;text-align:center;\">Rosario Sorrentino, Esq. · <span style=\"color:#6B4F4F;\">Florida Licensed Attorney</span></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:1rem;line-height:1.65;color:#27272a;text-align:left;max-width:54rem;\"><span data-en>Rosario Sorrentino, Esq., a Florida Licensed Attorney, believes that the most valuable legal counsel is not the kind that resolves legal problems after they happen but develops a plan for when they happen. Realizing that there are millions of non-citizens being arrested daily who cannot afford traditional legal defense if detained by ICE, he agreed to offer clients of DetencionDefensa.com his expertise* in order to provide them with access to the Courts if detained — utilizing Pro Se Habeas Corpus attorney-reviewed forms. Rosario also offers Immigration Legal Representation through Sorrentino Law Firm at reduced fees to DetencionDefensa.com customers. Visit <a href=\"https://sorrentinolawfirm.com/Immigration-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#3FA9F5;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">sorrentinolawfirm.com/Immigration-2/</a> for more information.</span><span data-es>Rosario Sorrentino, Esq., abogado con licencia en Florida, cree que el consejo legal más valioso no es el que resuelve los problemas legales después de que ocurren, sino el que desarrolla un plan para cuando ocurran. Al darse cuenta de que millones de no ciudadanos son arrestados diariamente y no pueden pagar una defensa legal tradicional si son detenidos por ICE, aceptó ofrecer a los clientes de DetencionDefensa.com su experiencia* para brindarles acceso a los tribunales si son detenidos — utilizando formularios de Habeas Corpus Pro Se revisados por abogado. Rosario también ofrece Representación Legal de Inmigración a través de Sorrentino Law Firm con tarifas reducidas para los clientes de DetencionDefensa.com. Visite <a href=\"https://sorrentinolawfirm.com/Immigration-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#3FA9F5;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">sorrentinolawfirm.com/Immigration-2/</a> para más información.</span><span data-ht>Rosario Sorrentino, Esq., yon avoka ki gen lisans nan Florida, kwè ke konsèy legal ki pi valab la pa sa ki rezoud pwoblèm legal apre yo rive, men sa ki devlope yon plan pou lè yo rive. Lè li reyalize gen dè milyon non-sitwayen ki ap arete chak jou ki pa ka peye defans legal tradisyonèl si ICE detni yo, li te dakò pou ofri kliyan DetencionDefensa.com ekspètiz li* pou ba yo aksè nan Tribinal yo si yo detni yo — lè l ap itilize fòm Habeas Corpus Pro Se ki revize pa avoka. Rosario tou ofri Reprezantasyon Legal Imigrasyon atravè Sorrentino Law Firm ak frè redwi pou kliyan DetencionDefensa.com. Vizite <a href=\"https://sorrentinolawfirm.com/Immigration-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#3FA9F5;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">sorrentinolawfirm.com/Immigration-2/</a> pou plis enfòmasyon.</span></p>\n  <p style=\"max-width:60rem;margin:1rem auto 0;font-size:0.78rem;line-height:1.55;color:#3f3f46;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;text-align:center;font-style:italic;\">* Subject to review and approval of limited retainer agreement.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<!-- DDFAQ -->\n<style>\n.ddfaq-sec{padding:4rem 1rem;background:#f8fafc;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1e293b;}\n.ddfaq-container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1rem;}\n.ddfaq-title{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,5vw,2.5rem);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem;text-align:center;}\n.ddfaq-sub{font-size:1.125rem;color:#64748b;margin:0 auto 3rem;max-width:600px;text-align:center;}\n.ddfaq-wrap{max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;}\n.ddfaq-item{background:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;border-radius:.5rem;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;}\n.ddfaq-q{padding:1.5rem;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#fff;border:none;width:100%;text-align:left;transition:all .3s;color:#1e293b;font-size:1rem;font-family:inherit;}\n.ddfaq-q:hover{background:#f8fafc;}\n.ddfaq-q.active{background:#1e40af;color:#fff;}\n.ddfaq-tog{transition:transform .3s;font-size:1.25rem;}\n.ddfaq-q.active .ddfaq-tog{transform:rotate(180deg);}\n.ddfaq-a{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:all .3s;color:#64748b;line-height:1.8;}\n.ddfaq-a.show{max-height:600px;padding:0 1.5rem 1.5rem;}\n.ddpart-sec{padding:4rem 1rem;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1e293b;}\n.ddpart-grid{display:grid;gap:1.5rem;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));margin-top:2rem;}\n.ddpart-card{background:#f8fafc;padding:1.5rem;border-radius:.75rem;text-align:center;}\n.ddpart-card h3{margin-bottom:.5rem;}\n.ddpart-card p{color:#64748b;font-size:.9rem;}\n</style>\n<section class=\"ddfaq-sec\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"ddfaq-container\">\n<h2 class=\"ddfaq-title\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;\">Frequently Asked Questions <a href=\"/checkout\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;padding:0.6rem 1.25rem;background:#1e40af;color:#fff;border-radius:0.5rem;text-decoration:none;\">Get Started →</a></h2>\n<p class=\"ddfaq-sub\">Answers to common questions.</p>\n<div class=\"ddfaq-wrap\">\n<div class=\"ddfaq-item\"><button class=\"ddfaq-q\"><span>Who can use DetencionDefensa?</span><span class=\"ddfaq-tog\">▼</span></button><div class=\"ddfaq-a\"><p>Any non-citizen in the U.S. who fears ICE detention. You don't need a pending deportation case. This is especially useful if you live in a high-risk ICE activity area.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"ddfaq-item\"><button class=\"ddfaq-q\"><span>Is this legal?</span><span class=\"ddfaq-tog\">▼</span></button><div class=\"ddfaq-a\"><p>Yes. DetencionDefensa received a UPL (Unauthorized Practice of Law) legal opinion from a Florida-licensed attorney. Preparing pro se documents is legal. We don't provide legal representation; we prepare documents you file yourself.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"ddfaq-item\"><button class=\"ddfaq-q\"><span>How much does it cost?</span><span class=\"ddfaq-tog\">▼</span></button><div class=\"ddfaq-a\"><p>$199 for initial preparation. Then $10/month to keep the app and your petition secure. No additional charges. Cancel anytime.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"ddfaq-item\"><button class=\"ddfaq-q\"><span>What is a Habeas Corpus petition?</span><span class=\"ddfaq-tog\">▼</span></button><div class=\"ddfaq-a\"><p>A Habeas Corpus petition (Form AO 242) is a request to a federal judge to review whether your detention was legal. It questions whether the government had legal authority to detain you. It's NOT a deportation defense; it's a question of detention legality (procedure).</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"ddfaq-item\"><button class=\"ddfaq-q\"><span>Will the attorney represent me in court?</span><span class=\"ddfaq-tog\">▼</span></button><div class=\"ddfaq-a\"><p>No. The attorney reviews your petition and completes it with detention details, but is NOT your litigation attorney. YOU file the petition pro se (as your own attorney) in federal court. This keeps the cost low.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"ddfaq-item\"><button class=\"ddfaq-q\"><span>Where is my data stored?</span><span class=\"ddfaq-tog\">▼</span></button><div class=\"ddfaq-a\"><p>Everything is stored ONLY on your phone, encrypted. After you answer questions, we delete it from our servers. When you press the emergency button, your petition goes to the attorney. Then it's deleted from your phone.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"ddfaq-item\"><button class=\"ddfaq-q\"><span>What if I press the button by accident?</span><span class=\"ddfaq-tog\">▼</span></button><div class=\"ddfaq-a\"><p>The app has a 3-second counter after pressing. You can cancel in those 3 seconds without sending anything. If it sends by mistake, your attorney will contact to confirm.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"ddfaq-item\"><button class=\"ddfaq-q\"><span>Do I need an immigration attorney too?</span><span class=\"ddfaq-tog\">▼</span></button><div class=\"ddfaq-a\"><p>A Habeas Corpus petition does NOT replace an immigration attorney for your deportation case. If you have a case in immigration court, you should get an attorney for that. DetencionDefensa is an EMERGENCY tool to question detention legality, not your immigration case.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"ddfaq-item\"><button class=\"ddfaq-q\"><span>Does it work on iOS and Android?</span><span class=\"ddfaq-tog\">▼</span></button><div class=\"ddfaq-a\"><p>Yes, DetencionDefensa is available on the App Store (iOS) and Google Play (Android). Both versions have the same features and security.</p></div></div>\n</div></div></section>\n<section class=\"ddpart-sec\" id=\"partners\"><div class=\"ddfaq-container\">\n<h2 class=\"ddfaq-title\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;\">Trusted Partnerships <a href=\"/checkout\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;padding:0.6rem 1.25rem;background:#1e40af;color:#fff;border-radius:0.5rem;text-decoration:none;\">Get Started →</a></h2>\n<p class=\"ddfaq-sub\">Partnering with local churches and nonprofit organizations.</p>\n<div class=\"ddpart-grid\">\n<div class=\"ddpart-card\"><h3>Partnering with Churches</h3><p>Offering group discounts to parishioners of religious organizations. Have your pastor contact DetencionDefensa for guidelines.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ddpart-card\"><h3>Partnering with Community Nonprofit Organizations</h3><p>Providing limited scholarships and low-cost, no-cost programs on a sliding scale to shelters and other nonprofit organizations.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ddpart-card\"><h3>Partnering with No-Kill Animal Shelters</h3><p>If you register a pet on the app for rescue, if detained, we will contact a no-kill shelter on your behalf to rescue the pet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ddpart-card\"><h3>Partnering with Low-Cost Immigration Attorneys</h3><p>Connecting clients with vetted immigration attorneys who offer reduced fees to DetencionDefensa customers.</p></div>\n</div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"precio\">\n    <!-- ROLES -->\n    <div class=\"nlf-roles\">\n      <h3>\n        <span data-es>Quién hace <em>qué</em>.</span>\n        <span data-en>Who does <em>what</em>.</span><span data-ht>Ki moun ki fè <em>kisa</em>.</span>\n        <a href=\"/checkout\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:1rem;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;padding:0.6rem 1.25rem;background:#1e40af;color:#fff;border-radius:0.5rem;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:middle;\">Get Started →</a>\n      </h3>\n      <p>\n        <span data-es>Cada paso le pertenece a una persona. Esta lista importa.</span>\n        <span data-en>Each step belongs to one person. This list matters.</span><span data-ht>Chak etap apatni a yon moun. Lis sa a enpòtan.</span>\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"nlf-roles-grid\">\n        <div class=\"nlf-role\">\n          <div class=\"who\"><span data-es>DETENCIONDEFENSA.COM</span><span data-en>DETENCIONDEFENSA.COM</span><span data-ht>DETENCIONDEFENSA.COM</span></div>\n          <div class=\"what\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 0.6rem;\"><span data-es>Le ofrece una alternativa de bajo costo a la costosa defensa posterior al arresto, brindando acceso al recurso de Habeas Corpus Pro Se a personas que no hablan inglés y que temen ser arrestadas por ICE. Provee la traducción y mecanografía de la información básica no-legal del formulario.</span><span data-en>Provides you with a low cost alternative to costly post arrest detention defense by offering Pro Se Habeas Corpus accessibility to non-English speaking persons in fear of ICE arrest. Provides translation & typing of the basic non-legal information on the form.</span><span data-ht>Ba w yon altènatif a ba pri pou defans apre-arestasyon ki koute chè, lè li bay aksè a Habeas Corpus Pro Se pou moun ki pa pale anglè epi ki gen pè pou ICE arete yo. Li bay tradiksyon ak tipaj enfòmasyon debaz ki pa legal sou fòm nan.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 0.6rem;\"><span data-es>Lo conecta con abogados que aceptan revisar el formulario Pro Se traducido y mecanografiado una vez redactado, y reenvían el formulario a la aplicación en su teléfono para almacenamiento seguro.</span><span data-en>Links you with Attorney&#39;s that agree to review the typed and translated Pro Se Form when drafted and forward the form to the App on your phone for safe storage.</span><span data-ht>Konekte w avèk avoka ki dakò pou revize fòm Pro Se ki tape epi tradui yo lè li redije, epi voye fòm nan nan aplikasyon sou telefòn ou pou estokaj san danje.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span data-es>Si lo detienen, lo localiza, contacta a su contacto de emergencia y, una vez localizado, informa al abogado los datos necesarios para completar el habeas corpus.</span><span data-en>If detained locate you, contact emergency contact &amp; once you are located advise the Attorney of the information needed to complete the habeas corpus.</span><span data-ht>Si yo arete w, li lokalize w, kontakte kontak dijans ou, epi yon fwa yo jwenn ou li enfòme avoka a enfòmasyon ki nesesè yo pou konplete habeas corpus la.</span></p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"nlf-role\">\n          <div class=\"who\"><span data-es>EL ABOGADO</span><span data-en>THE ATTORNEY</span><span data-ht>AVOKA A</span></div>\n          <div class=\"what\"><span data-es>El abogado acepta ser contratado por usted con el único propósito de revisar el borrador antes de enviarlo a su teléfono. Después de que lo detengan, revisar y completar el formulario de habeas corpus pro se, enviárselo por correo legal junto con un sobre pre-dirigido al secretario del tribunal. No acepta representarlo en la corte, presentar ni revisar ningún otro documento. Sus servicios están limitados por el acuerdo de honorarios que usted firmó. Asegúrese de leerlo.</span><span data-en>The attorney agrees to be hired by you for the purpose of checking the draft before sending it to your phone. After you are detained, checking and completing the habeas corpus pro se form, mailing it to you by legal mail along with an envelope pre-addressed to the clerk of the court. He does not agree to represent you in court, file, or review any other papers. His services are limited by the retainer agreement you agreed to. Make sure you read it.</span><span data-ht>Avoka a dakò pou w anboche l sèlman pou tcheke bouyon an anvan li voye l nan telefòn ou. Aprè yo detni w, pou tcheke epi konplete fòm habeas corpus pro se a, voye l ba ou pa lapòs legal ansanm ak yon anvlòp ki gen adrès grefye tribinal la sou li. Li pa dakò reprezante w nan tribinal la, depoze, oswa revize okenn lòt papye. Sèvis li yo limite pa kontra retainer ou te dakò a. Asire w ou li li.</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"nlf-role\">\n          <div class=\"who\"><span data-es>USTED</span><span data-en>YOU</span><span data-ht>OU</span></div>\n          <div class=\"what\"><span data-es>Da los hechos. Firma el formulario. Lo entrega al juez. Haga cualquier otra cosa que requiera el Secretario del Tribunal y el Tribunal, y cumpla con todas las reglas y regulaciones posteriores a la presentación.</span><span data-en>Give the facts. Sign the form. File it with the judge. Do any other things required by the Clerk of the Court, the Court, and comply with all post-filing rules and regulations.</span><span data-ht>Bay faktè yo. Siyen fòm nan. Depoze l bay jij la. Fè nenpòt lòt bagay Grefye Tribinal la ak Tribinal la mande, epi respekte tout règ ak règleman aprè depo a.</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"nlf-role\">\n          <div class=\"who\"><span data-es>EL JUEZ</span><span data-en>THE JUDGE</span><span data-ht>JIJ LA</span></div>\n          <div class=\"what\"><span data-es>Lee su petición. Decide su caso.</span><span data-en>Reads your petition. Decides your case.</span><span data-ht>Li petisyon w. Deside ka w.</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- FOOTER -->\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"footer-grid\">\n    <div>\n      <h6>DetencionDefensa.com, Inc.</h6>\n      <p style=\"line-height:1.7;\">\n        <span data-es>Una corporación de Delaware</span><span data-en>A Delaware corporation</span><span data-ht>Yon kòporasyon Delaware</span><br>\n        390 NE 191st Street, Suite 58999<br>\n        Miami, FL 33179<br>\n        Tel: 534-202-6852<br><br>\n        <strong style=\"color:var(--gold);\">NOT A LAW FIRM</strong>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <h6><span data-es>Producto</span><span data-en>Product</span><span data-ht>Pwodwi</span></h6>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"#precio\"><span data-es>Cómo funciona</span><span data-en>How it works</span><span data-ht>Kijan li mache</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#app\">SEND DOCS</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#precio\"><span data-es>Precio</span><span data-en>Price</span><span data-ht>Pri</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#preguntas\">FAQ</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#not-law-firm\"><span data-es>NO somos abogados</span><span data-en>Not a Law Firm</span><span data-ht>Pa avoka</span></a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <h6>Legal</h6>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"#\"><span data-es>Acuerdo del cliente</span><span data-en>Customer agreement</span><span data-ht>Akò kliyan</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#\"><span data-es>Privacidad</span><span data-en>Privacy</span><span data-ht>Vi prive</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#\"><span data-es>Términos</span><span data-en>Terms</span><span data-ht>Tèm</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#\"><span data-es>Reembolsos</span><span data-en>Refunds</span><span data-ht>Ranbousman</span></a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <h6><span data-es>Contacto</span><span data-en>Contact</span><span data-ht>Kontak</span></h6>\n      <ul>\n        <li>702-553-1790</li>\n        <li>proseforms@atomicmail.io</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer-disclaimer\">\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;\">\n      <strong><span data-es>NO SOMOS UN BUFETE DE ABOGADOS · NO DAMOS ASESORÍA LEGAL · USTED FIRMA · USTED PRESENTA.</span><span data-en>NOT A LAW FIRM · NO LEGAL ADVICE · YOU SIGN · YOU FILE.</span><span data-ht>NOU PA YON KABINÈ AVOKA · NOU PA BAY KONSÈY LEGAL · OU SIYEN · OU DEPOZE.</span></strong>\n      <span data-es>DetencionDefensa.com, Inc. NO es un bufete de abogados, NO da asesoría legal, NO recomienda si o cuándo presentar, NO aparece en corte, y NO se comunica con ningún juez, secretario, ni parte contraria. Nuestro rol está limitado a actividades ministeriales: traducir las respuestas factuales suministradas por el cliente, mecanografiarlas en el Formulario AO 242 (28 U.S.C. § 2241 petición de habeas corpus) y en la solicitud de exención de costos in forma pauperis — ambos formularios publicados gratis por las cortes de los EE. UU. — proporcionar la app móvil que almacena el formulario en el teléfono del cliente, borrar la información personal del cliente de nuestros servidores después de la preparación, y enviar — solo si el cliente activa el plan — el formulario preparado junto con formularios en blanco, ejemplos y un sobre prepagado, para que el cliente complete cualquier entrada final, firme y presente la petición pro se. El cliente solo selecciona qué formulario presentar, completa cualquier entrada final, firma y envía. El cliente debe consultar con un abogado licenciado en su jurisdicción si enfrenta detención. Los resultados pasados no garantizan resultados futuros.</span>\n      <span data-en>DetencionDefensa.com, Inc. is NOT a law firm, does NOT give legal advice, does NOT recommend whether or when to file, does NOT appear in court, and does NOT communicate with any judge, clerk, or opposing party. Our role is strictly limited to ministerial activities: translating customer-supplied factual answers, typing them onto Form AO 242 (28 U.S.C. § 2241 petition for writ of habeas corpus) and the in forma pauperis fee-waiver application — both forms supplied free by the U.S. District Courts — providing the mobile application that stores the prepared form on the customer's own phone, scrubbing the customer's personal information from our servers after preparation, and mailing — only upon the customer's own activation of the plan — the prepared form together with blank forms, samples, and a postage-paid return envelope, so the customer can complete any final entries, sign, and file the petition pro se. The customer alone selects which form to file, completes any final entries, signs, and mails. Anyone facing detention should consult licensed counsel in their jurisdiction. Past results do not guarantee future outcomes.</span><span data-ht>DetencionDefensa.com, Inc. PA yon kabinè avoka, PA bay konsèy legal, PA rekòmande si oswa kilè pou depoze, PA parèt nan tribinal, epi PA kominike avèk okenn jij, grefye, oswa pati ki opoze. Wòl nou estriktiman limite a aktivite ministeryèl: tradui repons faktyèl kliyan an bay yo, tape yo sou Fòm AO 242 (28 U.S.C. § 2241 petisyon pou ekri habeas corpus) ak aplikasyon in forma pauperis pou egzansyon frè — toude fòm yo bay gratis pa Tribinal Distri Etazini yo — bay aplikasyon mobil ki estoke fòm prepare a sou telefòn pwòp kliyan an, efase enfòmasyon pèsonèl kliyan an nan sèvè nou apre preparasyon, epi voye nan lapòs — sèlman lè kliyan an aktive plan an pou kont li — fòm prepare a ansanm avèk fòm vid, egzanp, ak yon anvlòp retounen ki gen tenm peye, pou kliyan an ka konplete nenpòt antre final, siyen, epi depoze petisyon an pro se. Kliyan an pou kont li chwazi ki fòm pou depoze, konplete nenpòt antre final, siyen, epi voye nan lapòs. Nenpòt moun k ap fè fas ak detansyon ta dwe konsilte avoka ki gen lisans nan jiridiksyon yo. Rezilta pase pa garanti rezilta nan lavni.</span>\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      <span data-es>Aclaración sobre la naturaleza del formulario: El Formulario AO 242 <strong>no</strong> se presenta en la corte de inmigración y <strong>no</strong> impugna ninguna decisión migratoria. Es una petición presentada en una corte federal de distrito de los Estados Unidos bajo 28 U.S.C. § 2241, que invoca el writ de habeas corpus — uno de los writs más antiguos del derecho angloamericano, protegido por el Artículo I, Sección 9 de la Constitución de los Estados Unidos — y se presenta pro se por el peticionario.</span>\n      <span data-en>Clarification regarding the nature of the form: Form AO 242 is <strong>not</strong> filed in immigration court and does <strong>not</strong> challenge any immigration decision. It is a petition filed in a U.S. federal district court under 28 U.S.C. § 2241, invoking the writ of habeas corpus — among the oldest writs in Anglo-American law, protected by Article I, Section 9 of the U.S. Constitution — filed pro se by the petitioner.</span><span data-ht>Klarifikasyon sou nati fòm nan: Fòm AO 242 <strong>pa</strong> depoze nan tribinal imigrasyon epi <strong>li pa</strong> konteste okenn desizyon sou imigrasyon. Se yon petisyon ki depoze nan yon tribinal distri federal Etazini dapre 28 U.S.C. § 2241, ki envoke writ habeas corpus la — youn nan writ ki pi ansyen nan lwa anglo-ameriken, ki pwoteje pa Atik I, Seksyon 9 nan Konstitisyon Etazini — depoze pro se pa petisyonè a.</span>\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin-top:1rem;font-size:0.85rem;line-height:1.6;color:#3f3f46;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.15);padding-top:0.8rem;\"><span data-en>You are charged two fees and sign 2 separate agreements — all included in the $199.00 Plan. These are for separate services. Part of this $199 charge is paid to DetencionDefensa.com for translation &amp; typing services directly; and a fee is paid directly to Rosario Sorrentino, Esq., a Florida-licensed attorney, for reviewing your forms before you see them and to complete and mail the forms after you are detained. You must review and approve the limited service agreement with DetencionDefensa.com and Rosario Sorrentino\u2019s Limited Retainer Agreement before paying the fee. <strong>READ THEM CAREFULLY.</strong></span></p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class='footer-bottom'>\n    <span>© 2026 DetencionDefensa.com, Inc. · <span data-es>Todos los derechos reservados</span><span data-en>All rights reserved</span><span data-ht>Tout dwa rezève</span></span>\n    <a href='https://www.immigrantdefenseproject.org/infographics/#9-know-your-rights-when-ice-pulls-you-over' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' style='color:var(--gold,#e8a04a);text-decoration:underline;'>Know your rights</a>\n    <span>detenciondefensa.com</span>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n";